From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:06:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 311/333] [ae-patch] Notify slot, status, label and effort
 hooks only for their own query keys

A session switch fires hundreds of query-cache events, and four AE hooks re-scanned the
whole cache on every one. They now subscribe through subscribeToQueryKeys, which wakes
only for added, removed or updated queries under the keys each hook reads. The
OpenTelemetry setup moves to telemetryOtel.ts behind a dynamic import, so zone.js no
longer loads on every page when tracing is off.
